cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software

title: "Burger-Cell: An Open-Source Heterogeneous ROS 2 Framework for Kinova Gen3 Manipulation, AprilTag Perception, and VLM-Guided Spatial Reasoning (burger_delivery)"
abstract: >-
  Advanced collaborative robotics environment built on ROS 2 Jazzy. Integrates
  manipulation with a Kinova Gen3 arm, mobile robots, AprilTag-based visual
  perception, motion planning with MoveIt 2, and the integration of AI models
  (Gemini-Robotics) for semantic scene understanding. Developed for teaching
  and applied research in Mechatronics Engineering at Universidad Militar
  Nueva Granada.

